    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_derby_win">Fans celebrate {team}'s derby victory</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_derby_win">The supporters of {team} celebrate the derby victory exuberantly. The mood around the club is euphoric.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_derby_loss">Derby frustration at {team}</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_derby_loss">The derby defeat hits the fans and the club environment hard. The media significantly increase the pressure on {team}.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_big_win">{team} makes a statement</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_big_win">The convincing victory provides momentum. Fans and the board believe {team} is on the right track.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_big_loss">Critical questions after heavy defeat</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_big_loss">After {team}'s clear defeat, the media and fans demand a response.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_win_streak_3">{team} rides a wave of success</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_win_streak_3">Three wins in a row create euphoria. The fans have renewed faith in the team's sporting development.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_loss_streak_3">Pressure grows on {team}</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_loss_streak_3">After three defeats in a row, the board and fans expect a clear response.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_loss_streak_5">Crisis mood at {team}</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_loss_streak_5">Five defeats in a row cause major unrest. The media openly speak of a crisis.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_cup_upset_win">{team} pulls off a cup upset</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_cup_upset_win">The victory against stronger opposition electrifies fans and the media. The board rewards the cup performance.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_cup_elimination_weaker">Cup humiliation</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_cup_elimination_weaker">Elimination from the cup against weaker opposition brings criticism around {team}.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_transfer_sale">Fans discuss sale at {team}</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_transfer_sale">The sale of {player} is a major topic among fans and the media. The reaction depends on how convincingly the club explains the decision.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_transfer_signing">New signing raises expectations</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_transfer_signing">The signing of {player} raises new expectations among fans and the board.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_mission_completed">Board objective achieved</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_mission_completed">{team} achieves an important board objective. This strengthens the manager's position.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_mission_failed">Board objective missed</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_mission_failed">{team} misses a board objective. The board expects visible corrections.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_interview_answer">Reactions to interview answer</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_interview_answer">The response to the media question has been assessed. Fans, media, the board and the team react differently.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_board_crisis">Board grows uneasy</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_board_crisis">Board satisfaction at {team} has fallen to just {board}%. Nervousness is growing inside the club.</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_title_board_support">Board backs the manager</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_story_message_board_support">With board satisfaction at {board}%, the manager enjoys strong backing at {team}.</message>

    <message id="fanpressure_reason_trait_star_performance">Specialist impresses</message>
    <message id="fanpressure_reason_trait_big_moment">Special ability decides the match</message>
